From: StageX <stagex@stagex.tools>
Subject: build core extensions entirely from supplied source trees

Disable optional Rust and CUDA accelerator add-ons whose independent source and
runtime dependency graphs are not packaged yet. Keep the Python frontend and
core CPU/CUDA native extensions. Also permit StageX Clang plus a source-built
LLVM OpenMP runtime for the CPU backend, and use Clang's supported umbrella
header for the x86 monitor/mwait intrinsics.

--- a/requirements/cpu.txt	2026-07-27 08:57:50.000000000 +0800
+++ b/requirements/cpu.txt	2026-08-08 23:00:00.000000000 +0000
@@ -4 +4 @@
